// HZM coop - 'Death Sounds Reborn' varied death voices (converted .ogg -> .wav, 22050 mono).
// 334 aliases (coop_deathvox1..334) pooled + played at random on EVERY actor and player death
// (see coop_mod/deathvox.scr). HUMAN-FACTION deaths ONLY - the non-human 'anomaly' sound and the
// bonus run/health/pain voice files were dropped so every grunt sounds human. Auto-registered.
// Format: soundparms <vol> <volMod> <pitch> <pitchMod> <minDist> <maxDist> <channel> <load> maps
// channel 'auto' = 3D positional, no dialog/subtitle handling; 'loaded' = in-memory (instant).

aliascache coop_deathvox1 sound/coop_deathvox/dv_001.wav soundparms 1.0 0.2 1.0 0.15 500 2200 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
